  "operative_text": "NEW SECTION Sec. 1 (new RCW section in chapter 9.41): (1) A dealer may not deliver more than one firearm to a purchaser or transferee within any 30-day period.\nNEW SECTION Sec. 1 (new RCW section in chapter 9.41): (2) Subsection (1) of this section does not apply to any of the following: (a) Any general authority Washington law enforcement agency or limited authority Washington law enforcement agency as those terms are defined in RCW  10.93.020; (b) Any correctional facility as defined in RCW  72.09.015; (c) Any private security company as defined in RCW  18.170.010;"
